## Remix Icon

The tray icon SVGs in `entry/src/main/resources/rawfile/tray/` are derived from
[Remix Icon](https://github.com/Remix-Design/RemixIcon), licensed under the
**Apache License 2.0**.

- Upstream: https://github.com/Remix-Design/RemixIcon
- License: https://github.com/Remix-Design/RemixIcon/blob/master/LICENSE

Used icons (from `icons/Editor/` and `icons/System/`):
- `link-m` — "connected" state
- `link-unlink-m` — "disconnected" state
- `error-warning-fill` — "error / abnormal disconnect" state

Icons are recolored to white/black to match the HarmonyOS status-bar icon
convention (white for dark wallpapers, black for light wallpapers). Screen icons
are generated by `scripts/gen_tray_svg.py`.

